{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00577","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享先蚕乐章 昭庆 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享先蚕乐章 昭庆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙坛礼既毕，神驾俨将昇。\n伫属深祥起，方期庶绩凝。\n虔诚资宇内，务本勖黎蒸。\n灵心昭备享，率土洽休徵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}